{"type":"FeatureCollection","name":"kenton-required-building-lines","crs":{"type":"name","properties":{"name":"urn:ogc:def:crs:EPSG::2913"}},"source":{"map":"Kenton plan district Map 538-4 (Required Building Lines), as the City publishes it: Portland Maps https://www.portlandmaps.com/arcgis/rest/services/Public/BPS_Zoning_Code_Layers/MapServer/72 (BPS Zoning Code Layers, Required Building Areas), the 13 features PLDIST \"KN\" (8 TYPE \"setback\", Zero setback standard; 5 TYPE \"pedestrian\", Pedestrian amenities standard), every field, EPSG:2913, fetched 2026-11-13, sha256 67c3a053ba61e5760596e14a6a53433e6d6cdef617685f94a5c47044913bb4b9","quote":"or/multnomah/portland/33.538.txt#L110-L114","says":"These regulations apply to site frontages shown on Map 538-4. Multi-dwelling zoned sites are exempt. Exterior walls of buildings designed to meet these requirements must be at least 25 feet high; buildings extend to the street lot line along the whole frontage (zero setback standard) or along at least 75 percent of it (pedestrian amenities standard).","sheet":"https://www.portland.gov/sites/default/files/code/538-kenton-pd_1.pdf, retrieved 2026-11-13, PDF page 10 (Map 538-4, \"Map Revised July 24, 2015\"), sha256 64db0c2bc82aeb6047652e66aa527ce0d667eae5ce7c7254b8e19a8fb26d0baf. The frontages are drawn on the map image only; the chapter PDF has no text layer on the map page.","method":"Each traced lot is a run-124 taxlot (flats.lots, the lot shapes the screen reads) zoned CM2, CM3 or CE in the screen and at least nine tenths inside Kenton CM2/CM3/CE zoning (Portland Maps Public/Zoning layer 0, PLDIST KN, fetched 2026-11-13) that a Map 538-4 frontage polygon overlaps by at least 100 sq ft (the smallest overlap is 623 sq ft; no lot overlaps by between 1 and 622 sq ft), taken whole. 25 lots. Checked against the sheet 2026-11-13: the layer's 13 polygons match the map's 8 grey (zero setback) and 5 hatched (pedestrian amenities) frontages, both sides of N Denver Ave from the district line to N Watts St, N Interstate Pl and N Willis Blvd. Coordinates to 0.01 ft. Lots a frontage touches without overlapping, lots partly multi-dwelling zoned, and lots on a Map 538-6 frontage are not here: they ride pdx_plan_district_unmeasured (YELLOW).","read_by":"flats-encoder kenton-538 (Opus)","read_on":"2026-11-13"},"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"what":"kenton-required-building-lines"},"geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[7642287.45,705515.14],[7642288.11,705540.13],[7642288.78,705565.13],[7642289.44,705590.12],[7642290.11,705615.11],[7642290.77,705640.1],[7642291.44,705665.09],[7642292.1,705690.08],[7642292.77,705715.07],[7642397.73,705712.28],[7642397.07,705687.29],[7642396.4,705662.3],[7642395.73,705637.31],[7642395.07,705612.31],[7642394.4,705587.32],[7642393.74,705562.33],[7642393.07,705537.34],[7642392.41,705512.35],[7642287.45,705515.14]]],[[[7642106.29,705645.52],[7642107.05,705670.51],[7642107.8,705695.49],[7642108.55,705720.48],[7642213.51,705717.32],[7642212.75,705692.33],[7642212.0,705667.35],[7642211.25,705642.36],[7642210.5,705617.37],[7642105.54,705620.53],[7642106.29,705645.52]]],[[[7642110.79,705830.46],[7642111.54,705855.45],[7642112.29,705880.44],[7642112.38,705883.44],[7642112.6,705890.44],[7642113.05,705905.43],[7642113.8,705930.42],[7642114.55,705955.41],[7642115.23,705980.86],[7642220.18,705977.76],[7642219.5,705952.25],[7642218.75,705927.26],[7642218.0,705902.27],[7642217.55,705887.28],[7642217.34,705880.28],[7642217.25,705877.28],[7642216.49,705852.29],[7642215.74,705827.3],[7642214.99,705802.32],[7642214.23,705777.33],[7642109.28,705780.49],[7642110.04,705805.48],[7642110.79,705830.46]]],[[[7642297.04,705875.02],[7642297.7,705900.01],[7642298.37,705925.0],[7642299.03,705949.99],[7642299.7,705975.27],[7642404.66,705972.17],[7642403.99,705947.2],[7642403.33,705922.21],[7642402.66,705897.22],[7642402.0,705872.22],[7642426.99,705871.56],[7642424.33,705771.59],[7642399.34,705772.26],[7642294.37,705775.05],[